ious figure appears dressed as the Red Death itself—dripping in blood and wearing a corpse-like mask—causing terror and outrage. The prince, enraged, pursues the figure through all seven rooms with a dagger, but the figure turns in the black chamber, and the prince collapses dead. The revelers rush in, only to find the mask and robes empty, realizing the plague has infiltrated their sanctuary, and one by one, they die as the clock stops and darkness claims all.</div>\n                \n                \n                <div class=\"chapter-characters\" style=\"margin-top: 0.75rem;\">\n                    <strong style=\"margin-right: 0.5rem; color: var(--muted);\">Characters:</strong>\n                    \n                    <span class=\"tag\">Prince Prospero</span>\n                    \n                    <span class=\"tag\">The masked figure (Red Death)</span>\n                    \n                    \n                </div>\n                \n            </div>\n            \n        </section>\n        </div>\n\n        <div id=\"characters\" class=\"tab-content\">\n        <section>\n            <h2>👥 Character Guide</h2>\n\n            <!-- Confidence Filter -->\n            <div style=\"margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\">\n                <label style=\"color: var(--muted); margin-right: 0.5rem;\">\n                    <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"show-low-confidence-only\" onchange=\"filterByConfidence(this.checked)\">\n                    Show only low-confidence items\n                </label>\n            </div>\n\n            \n\n            \n            <div class=\"character-group\">\n                <h3>Supporting Characters <span class=\"count\">2</span></h3>\n                <table>\n                    <thead>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th>Name</th>\n                            <th>Mentions</th>\n                            <th>First Appears</th>\n                            <th>Aliases</th>\n                        